From 035fd19d6a86d3ff14a61244bc422da29d2e0593 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:34:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(nav): street-level turn-by-turn by default (OSRM),
 named + located steps

- settings: ROUTING_BASE_URL defaults to OSRM (not in tests) so routes are navigation-grade
- osrm_provider: steps carry street name + turn location
- views_compat: /navigation/route prefers the street-level route for car/motorcycle; steps gain turn/distance_km
- tests: mocked-engine turn-by-turn + honest fallback
