Subject: [PATCH 5/6] fix(images): crash on mismatched photos + stop wrong
 photos on places

- serializers: is_destination_specific_image used known_places before assigning it (UnboundLocalError -> 500 on any destination with an approved photo whose URL names another place). Define it first.
- serializers: cover column and gallery photos now need place evidence. A named photo must name THIS place (city/district alone no longer counts, a business needs more than its city); photos reused by 3+ destinations are rejected; camera-style filenames (IMG_2041) stay visible per #22; staff-chosen photos always pass.
- Measured on the seed data: 5,354 places showed a photo shared by 3+ places and 1,661 hostels/hotels showed landmark photos; after: 238 / 20.
- tests: cover integrity
