Hospital/police/hotel directory rows imported from district lists share one town-centre point (28 Biratnagar hospitals on one coordinate; coordinate_source/status blank on all rows). Three or more rows on one 4-decimal point now count as approximate: distance_label becomes '≈ X km (area point)', is_approximate=true, and precise rows sort first. Rows that merely coincide with a destination point are NOT flagged (OSM destination records carry real coordinates).
Tests: 3 cases, fail without the change.
